            "review_title": "Review at Pho Dinh Thai Van Lung-uraetei-yakiniku",
            "review_text": "TravelingFoodie\nMiami, Florida10803 contributions\n0\nGreat food, good value\nDec 2024 • Friends\nCraving a yakiniku dinner, we decided to visit this spot in the heart of the Japanese quarter, close to where we were staying—and we were not disappointed!\n\nBoth types of wagyu were absolutely delicious, with the perfect balance of flavor and tenderness. The Iberico pork was seasoned to perfection, and the accompanying sauces, fresh vegetables, seaweed salad, and kimchi complemented the meal beautifully.\nWe left thoroughly satisfied and would highly recommend this place to any yakiniku lover looking for a memorable dining experience.\nRead more\nWritten December 31, 2024",
